<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;color:#0D523F;">
  Your staff account was updated
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#888B8B;">
  Profile changes
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  An administrator updated your Dukka staff account. Review the details below so your records stay accurate.
</p>

{{#> details}}
  {{> detail-row label="Email" value=email}}
  {{#if previousEmail}}
  {{> detail-row label="Previous email" value=previousEmail}}
  {{/if}}
  {{#if isActive}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value="Active"}}
  {{else}}
  {{> detail-row label="Status" value="Inactive"}}
  {{/if}}
{{/details}}

{{#> tip title="What this means"}}
  If your email changed, use the new address the next time you sign in. If your account was set to inactive, you may lose portal access until an administrator reactivates it.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  Questions about this update? Reach out to your administrator.
</p>
